{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "role": "hook",
      "narration": "Your heart is doing something insane right now.",
      "headline": "Your heart is insane",
      "highlight": [
        "heart"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "excited",
        "pose": "jumping"
      },
      "from": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 102
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "Every single day, an adult heart beats about one hundred thousand times. Without a break!",
      "headline": "Beats in one day",
      "highlight": [
        "one day"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "surprised",
        "pose": "pointing"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "bigNumber",
        "value": 100000,
        "unit": "beats",
        "label": "every single day",
        "icon": "heart"
      },
      "from": 102,
      "durationInFrames": 185
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "And it is not huge at all. Your heart is a muscle about the size of your fist.",
      "headline": "As big as your fist",
      "highlight": [
        "fist"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "happy",
        "pose": "idle"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "spotlight",
        "icon": "hand",
        "caption": "Your heart is about the size of your fist"
      },
      "from": 287,
      "durationInFrames": 164
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "With every beat, it squeezes blood out to your whole body. Then the blood comes back to be pumped again.",
      "headline": "One loop of blood",
      "highlight": [
        "blood"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "pointing"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "steps",
        "steps": [
          {
            "icon": "heart",
            "text": "Heart squeezes"
          },
          {
            "icon": "drop",
            "text": "Blood flows out"
          },
          {
            "icon": "hand",
            "text": "Reaches your body"
          },
          {
            "icon": "heart",
            "text": "Comes back again"
          }
        ]
      },
      "from": 451,
      "durationInFrames": 201
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "In just one day, it pumps about seven thousand five hundred liters of blood. That is a lot of blood!",
      "headline": "Liters pumped per day",
      "highlight": [
        "per day"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "surprised",
        "pose": "idle"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "bigNumber",
        "value": 7500,
        "unit": "liters",
        "label": "of blood pumped per day",
        "icon": "drop"
      },
      "from": 652,
      "durationInFrames": 204
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "Inside, your heart has four rooms called chambers. Two on top, and two on the bottom, working as a team.",
      "headline": "Four rooms inside",
      "highlight": [
        "Four rooms"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "excited",
        "pose": "pointing"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "iconGrid",
        "icon": "heart",
        "count": 4,
        "label": "chambers in your heart"
      },
      "from": 856,
      "durationInFrames": 217
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "Now zoom out. In one single year, your heart beats about thirty-five million times. Wow.",
      "headline": "Beats in one year",
      "highlight": [
        "one year"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "idle"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "compare",
        "unit": "beats",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "One day",
            "value": 100000,
            "icon": "clock"
          },
          {
            "label": "One year",
            "value": 35000000,
            "icon": "earth"
          }
        ]
      },
      "from": 1073,
      "durationInFrames": 198
    },
    {
      "role": "fact",
      "narration": "And over an average lifetime, it beats more than two and a half billion times. Billion!",
      "headline": "Over a whole life",
      "highlight": [
        "life"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "surprised",
        "pose": "pointing"
      },
      "visual": {
        "layout": "bigNumber",
        "value": 2.5,
        "decimals": 1,
        "unit": "billion",
        "label": "beats in a lifetime",
        "icon": "heart"
      },
      "from": 1271,
      "durationInFrames": 184
    },
    {
      "role": "recap",
      "narration": "Quick recap. Your fist-sized heart beats about one hundred thousand times a day, without ever stopping.",
      "headline": "Quick recap",
      "highlight": [
        "recap"
      ],
      "pip": {
        "expression": "happy",
